    "text": "WFMJ.com\nwebsite\nAkron\nPHOTOS: Akron Children's Hospital debuts new mascot\nBy Sarah Robles,\n2 hours agoAkron Children's Hospital debuted its new mascot on Wednesday. Patients, doctors and nurses all gathered within the hospital on Wednesday morning to welcome their new mascot \"Pip\". Additionally, mascots from the University of Akron, Youngstown State University, The Akron Zoo and several other organizations were in attendance to Pip's debut...\n1",
